    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Why do you say that one is stronger? Wouldn't the argument for congressional oversight—that privilege shouldn't be used to hide wrongdoing from the people's representatives—be more grounded in the principle of checks and balances?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
